# Generated IG source, for every project in this catalog.
#
# Each project's own .gitignore (written by `d2w fhir init`) already covers the build
# output - ig/fsh-generated/, ig/output/, ig/temp/, ig/input-cache/, ig/input/resources/,
# reports/. What it does not cover is the FSH and the markdown `d2w fhir generate` writes
# beside the two hand-authored files, because a real project commits those. This catalog
# does not: the trees here are the inputs, and `make verify-igs` regenerates the rest.

*/ig/input/fsh/*
!*/ig/input/fsh/aliases.fsh
*/ig/input/pagecontent/*
!*/ig/input/pagecontent/index.md

# The catalog runs through the workspace `d2w`, never through a project's own
# environment, so neither the lock nor the virtual environment is ever written here.
*/uv.lock
*/.venv/
